WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.030
Oxford.

2
00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:07.010
On 30 December 2020, the UK's medicines
regulator authorises a COVID nineteen

3
00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:09.590
vaccine developed with the university.

4
00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:16.050
On 15 February 2021, the WHO lists
two versions for emergency use.

5
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:18.410
One is made in the Republic of Korea.

6
00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:21.430
The other, by the Serum
Institute of India.

7
00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:25.390
That opened the way to COVAX,
the global sharing scheme.

8
00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:28.970
So how does one drug
company reach the world?

9
00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:31.390
Does it ship everything from the UK?

10
00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:35.410
In this mission, you'll follow a
medicine from breakthrough to patent.

11
00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:37.550
Then you'll map where
its medicines are made,

12
00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.410
and where the money flows back from.

13
00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:44.590
Your mission: explain how one
drug company reaches the world.
